  - dynamic bus lane
  - microsimulation
  - agentic AI
abstract: >-
  Tick-based microsimulator of a two-intersection urban corridor with a
  separate-process LangGraph decision agent. The agent (local or cloud LLM,
  deterministic rule, or passenger-pressure heuristic) activates pre-coded
  transit signal priority and dynamic bus lane actions through a fail-closed
  guard; the signal controller alone grants right of way. This release is the
  code behind the ACAT-TP evaluation campaign 9afdd49d.
